" data-coord=\"32658,31883,6\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32658, 31883, 6)</a> which has 3 Wyverns. The <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">dragons</a> at Ferngrims Gate are located at the <a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon%20Dragon%20Lair\">Kazordoon Dragon Lair</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32658,31895,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32658, 31895, 7)</a>) and a single dragon is located <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32688,31844,8\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32688, 31844, 8)</a>.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures in Ferngrims Gate</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Rabbit\"><img alt=\"Rabbit\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Rabbit_d384db.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Rabbit\">Rabbit</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">0</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">15</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">0</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Meat\">Meat</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Carrot\">Carrot</a> (uncommon)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Deer\"><img alt=\"Deer\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Deer_8cd0d3.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href